<title>USA: N.J. Housing Agency $200 mln won by Merrill.</title>
<headline>N.J. Housing Agency $200 mln won by Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. said it won $200 million of the New Jersey Housing and Mortgage Finance Agency Revenue bonds, with a true interest cost (TIC) of 5.436 percent.</p>
</text>
